      "extract": "TWISTED NEUMANN–ZAGIER MATRICES STAVROS GAROUFALIDIS AND SEOKBEOM YOON Dedicated to Walter Neumann and Don Zagier, with admiration. Abstract. The Neumann–Zagier matrices of an ideal triangulation are integer matrices with symplectic properties whose entries encode the number of tetrahedra that wind around each edge of the triangulation. They can be used as input data for the construction of a number of quantum",
